  "text": "Skip to mission information\nZoi\nServices\nContact\nOfficial website\n↗\n\nEMBASSY & CONSULAR OFFICE · LONDON\n\nEmbassy of Greece in London\n\nGreece’s embassy in London, with a separate consular office for passports, civil registration and other citizen services.\n\nLondon appointments\n↗\nFind a service\n\nYOUR NEXT STEP\n\nChoose the service. Check the guidance.\n\nPrepare your questions here, then continue with the mission through its published channels.\n\nLondon · United Kingdom\n\nCONSULAR SERVICES\n\nWhat do you need help with?\nFind a service\n01\nGreek passports\n\nRead the application and renewal guidance before choosing a passport appointment.\n\nOfficial guidance\n↗\nPrepare my visit →\n02\nCivil registration\n\nGuidance for births, marriages, divorces and deaths, including the correct consular district.\n\nOfficial guidance\n↗\nPrepare my visit →\n03\nPowers of attorney & notarial deeds\n\nRead the official notarial guidance and preparation steps before arranging your visit.\n\nOfficial guidance\n↗\nPrepare my visit →\n04\nMilitary matters\n\nFind the official service guidance and the appointment route for your circumstances.\n\nOfficial guidance\n↗\nPrepare my visit →\n05\nGreek citizenship\n\nReview the official citizenship service information and appointment guidance.\n\nOfficial guidance\n↗\nPrepare my visit →\n06\nSignatures & authorisations\n\nUse the official citizen-services guide to choose the correct document service.\n\nOfficial guidance\n↗\nPrepare my visit →\n\nTHE MISSION\n\nThe right office for your request.\n\nGreece’s embassy in London, with a separate consular office for passports, civil registration and other citizen services.\n\nConsular district\n\nThe London appointment provider lists Greater London, South West England, South East England, East Anglia and Wales. Other UK regions are directed to Manchester. Check your district before choosing an office.\n\nCheck official district guidance\n↗\n\nBEFORE YOUR VISIT\n\nArrive prepared.\n\nRead the service’s official document list and check your consular district before travelling. Services outside the online appointment list are arranged with the consular office by email.\n\nLondon appointments\n\nChoose the service on the official booking page. Zoi does not reserve an appointment or show live availability.\n\nContinue on the official site\n↗\nRead the official visiting guidance\n↗\n\nCONTACT & LOCATION\n\nSpeak to the right office.\nOfficial contact page\n↗\nEmbassy\ngremb.lon@mfa.gr\n+442072293850\nOffice information\n↗\nConsular office\ngrcon.lon@mfa.gr\n+442073135600\nOffice information\n↗\nConsular emergency\n\nConsular emergencies\n\n+447795961519\nOffice information\n↗\nFind the mission\n1A Holland Park, London W11 3TP, United Kingdom\nLook up this address\n↗\n\nOFFICIAL RESOURCES\n\nEmbassy departments\n↗\nVisas and official application guidance\n↗\nOfficial contact page\n↗\n\nOfficial pages reviewed 2026-10-15. Confirm requirements, fees and appointment arrangements with the office.\n\nView the official source\n↗\nExplore Zoi",
